OL,3,GNEWSAGiant flower 'carpet' created from
OL,4,A330,000 blooms
OL,5,
OL,6,FVolunteers have begun the painstaking
OL,7,Fprocess of laying more than 330,000
OL,8,Fdahlias to create a floral "carpet" in
OL,9,Fthe centre of Bradford.
OL,11,FWork on the 95ft (29m) hexagonal-shaped
OL,12,Fpublic artwork in Centenary Square
OL,13,Fbegan on Thursday, and will be
OL,14,Fofficially opened later.
OL,16,FLocal artist Shiraaz Ali used the
OL,17,Fcity's textile heritage and
OL,18,Fmulticultural population as the
OL,19,Finspiration for his design.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
