OL,3,GNEWSAGiant flower 'carpet' created from
OL,4,A330,000 blooms
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe flowers were grown and supplied by
OL,7,Fthe non-profit Tapis de fleurs de
OL,8,FBruxelles which has run the original
OL,9,FFlower Carpet event in Belgium since
OL,10,Fthe 1970s.
